<%# ISS-353 Phase 1 → ISS-354 Phase 2 Wave 2 — 멘션 단일 도트 (사람 단위 worst-state + intent_level)
    locals:
      dot : Hash {user_id, user_name, state, notification_id, intent_level}

    B1-b 결정: viewer 인자 없음. 서버 stateless 렌더 — 클라이언트(Wave 2b Stimulus)가
    <body data-current-user-id> 읽어 data-viewer-self 마킹.

    상태별 색상 (4종) × 인텐트 강도 (3단계 emerald):
      unread       → 회색 ○ (bg-ink-200 border-ink-300)
      viewed_only  → 노랑 ◐ (bg-amber-400)
      acknowledged → 녹색 ●
        intent 0 (FYI)        → bg-emerald-400 (연녹)
        intent 1 (확인 필수)   → bg-emerald-600 (표준)
        intent 2 (응답 필수)   → bg-emerald-700 (진녹)
      sla_overdue  → 빨강 테두리 (bg-white border-2 border-red-500) — Phase 2 활성

    클릭/호버:
      - 24x24 wrapper button — 모바일 터치 영역 보장 + 키보드 접근 가능
      - data-action="click->mention-dots#acknowledge" — Wave 2b에서 JS 작성
      - hover scale-1.33 (8px) + transition-transform
      - native title 툴팁 — Phase 3에서 호버 카드로 승격
%>
<%
  state  = dot[:state].to_s
  intent = dot[:intent_level].to_i
  dot_color_class = case state
                    when "unread"        then "bg-ink-200 border border-ink-300"
                    when "viewed_only"   then "bg-amber-400"
                    when "acknowledged"
                      if intent >= 2
                        "bg-emerald-700"
                      elsif intent >= 1
                        "bg-emerald-600"
                      else
                        "bg-emerald-400"
                      end
                    when "sla_overdue"   then "bg-white border-2 border-red-500"
                    else "bg-ink-200 border border-ink-300"
                    end
  state_label  = t("mentions.dot.state_#{state}", default: state)
  intent_label = ["@", "@@", "@@@"][intent]
  tooltip      = if intent > 0
                   "#{dot[:user_name]} — #{state_label} (#{intent_label})"
                 else
                   "#{dot[:user_name]} — #{state_label}"
                 end
%>
<button type="button"
        class="mention-dot-wrapper inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-300"
        data-action="click->mention-dots#acknowledge"
        data-prevent-card-open="true"
        data-user-id="<%= dot[:user_id] %>"
        data-notification-id="<%= dot[:notification_id] %>"
        data-state="<%= state %>"
        data-intent="<%= intent %>"
        title="<%= tooltip %>">
  <span class="mention-dot inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full <%= dot_color_class %> hover:scale-[1.33] transition-transform"></span>
</button>
